{"ts":"2026-07-18T05:42:19.707Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-18T05:42:19.706Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"Surface re-measurement 2026-07-18 (scripts/measure-agent-token-surface.mjs, post-PR#580/#581): MCP tools/list now 29 tools / 34,975 B / ~8,744 tokens — up from the pm-a22j baseline of 28 tools / 32,979 B / ~8.2k tokens (pm_graph added; growth passed the token-budget gate deliberately). Every new first-class tool now costs every agent cold start ~+500 tokens, which strengthens the case for the profile tiers this item owns: a graph-heavy agent needs pm_graph but a triage agent never does. Use these numbers as the before-figure when profiles land."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-18T05:42:19.707Z"}],"before_hash":"c7dfdf79bafe466278a3e5d431594ac0585c6684100d967569a64ff07b5d4968","after_hash":"cf7de93200e412b69b236a1b99704ca6f1a5b58a851b94b5bdc521ed8bde454f"}
